 "words": 184,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "He was seventy-five with his roots in the ground",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 3.77,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "His fathers' graves were all around",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 3.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Then a voice came through the evening air",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 3.22,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And it called him out to who knows where",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 2.74,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Leave your land, your kindred, and your father's house",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And go to the land I will show you",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I will make you into a great nation",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And in you all the families of the earth will be blessed",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Sarah packed the tent and the cooking pot",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 3.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Lot drove the flocks from the family plot",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No map to follow, no road to see",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Just a promise and a God he could not see",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Leave your land, your kindred, and your father's house",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.01,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And go to the land I will show you",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will make you into a great nation",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And in you all the families of the earth will be blessed",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "So Abram went, as the LORD had told him",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 4.97,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "So Abram went, not knowing where",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So Abram went, as the LORD had told him",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
